'''Super Pride''' is a [[mini-boss]] and one of the [[Seven Deadly Sins#Super Sins|Seven Super Deadly Sins]]. He is randomly encountered as an alternate version of {{e|Pride}}.

== Behavior ==
Super Pride wanders randomly around the room and performs one of two attacks:
* Spawns 2 {{e|Mega Troll Bomb}}s in randomly around the room.
** Super Pride is immune to his own Mega Troll Bombs.
* Fires 4 wave-like lasers from himself in an X-pattern and shoots 6 projectiles in all directions.
Super Pride deals a whole heart of contact damage.

== Notes ==
* Super Pride is immune to his Troll Bombs.
* {{dlc|a+}} Rarely, Super Pride can spawn with 2 {{e|Poky|text=Pokies}}.
* {{dlc|nr}} Super Pride can drop {{i|Dead Cat}} even if Isaac has already encountered / picked it up.
* Super Pride is not immune to damage from his own Mega Troll Bombs while under the effect of {{i|Anima Sola}}.

== Trivia ==
* Like {{e|Pride}}, Super Pride's expressions during its attacks are a reference to "rage comic" memes; he briefly assumes a [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/trollface troll face] before spawning Troll Bombs, and resembles [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/forever-alone forever alone] before firing lasers.
* The [[wikipedia:Seven Deadly Sins|Seven Deadly Sins]] that these mini-bosses are based upon are, in Christian teachings, a classification of vices from which all others are derived.

